--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Act3Ep2Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622912
    - rid: 4972360184803622913
    - rid: 4972360184803622915
    - rid: 4972360184803622916
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Here we are.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622914
    - rid: 4972360184803622917
    - rid: 4972360184803622918
    - rid: 4972360184803622919
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Take her to one of the free cells then report back to me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, sir.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622979
    - rid: 4972360184803622981
    - rid: 4972360184803622982
    - rid: 4972360184803622983
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The soldier leads Sayori to a hallway that has a bunch of cells, two
      of which are already occupied.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Since it's closer to him, the soldier opens up the cell on their left
      and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796549
    - rid: 4972360184803622985
    - rid: 4972360184803622986
    - rid: 4972360184803622987
    - rid: 4972360184803622988
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Shoves Sayori into the cell, closing and locking the door behind her.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You didn't have to shove me-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622989
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: Be quiet. You are a criminal, you are supposed to be treated harshly.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622990
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With that rude remark, the Thalmor soldier leaves to meet back up with
      his Justiciar as instructed.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622991
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (... are <b>you</b> still there?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622992
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (These guys are Thalmor, right?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622993
    - rid: 4972360184803622994
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: It seems so, yes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Like Ancano, those guys {mc} said were evil?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Am...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Am I gonna die?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622995
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622996
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803622997
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623002
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623006
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: Here she is, sir.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623011
    - rid: 4972360184803623012
    - rid: 4972360184803623048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Good, help me escort her to the interrogation room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623013
    - rid: 4972360184803623014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (... Interrogation room?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The Thalmor soldier unlocks the door to Sayori's cell, grabbing her arm
      to drag her out.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623017
    - rid: 4972360184803623018
    - rid: 4972360184803623019
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: Quit dragging your feet.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The soldier slaps Sayori for her impudence.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623020
    - rid: 4972360184803623021
    - rid: 4972360475574796550
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Even though she's been fairly cooperative thus far...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623023
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623024
    - rid: 4972360184803623025
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The smell of dried blood hits Sayori''s nose, the source of which is
      easily found near one of the stocks: a bucket of former limbs.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360184803623026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Help me get her into the rack.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e29da807434d3ee4d93a1bd54792c5dc, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Like a lamb led to the slaughter, Sayori can't bring herself to resist.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
